{
    "title": "WoW Books",
    "description": "\u201cWorld of Words\u201d revives the tradition of book collecting in a modern electronic format. Immerse yourself in the world of literature by collecting thematic collections and displaying them in your virtual bookcase.\r\n\r\n\u2022  Bookcase: Decorate and modernize your bookcase by adding new shelves and stocking them with beautiful books or decorative figurines. Create a cozy library atmosphere!\r\n\r\n\u2022  Collections: Create unique collections of books, themed by your favorite genres, authors, or years of publication.\r\n\r\n\u2022  Gamification: Get game coins (litcoins) for reading books. Litecoins can be spent on bookcase upgrades and other game features.\r\n\r\n\u2022  Literary Value: Enjoy reading books in the public domain, as well as works by contemporary authors with whom we have publishing agreements.\r\n\r\nWelcome to the world of words lovers, combining the passion of collecting and the joy of reading in one place!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u201cWorld of Words\u201d revives the tradition of book collecting in a modern electronic format. Immerse yourself in the world of literature by collecting thematic collections and displaying them in your virtual bookcase.<br><br>\u2022  Bookcase: Decorate and modernize your bookcase by adding new shelves and stocking them with beautiful books or decorative figurines. Create a cozy library atmosphere!<br><br>\u2022  Collections: Create unique collections of books, themed by your favorite genres, authors, or years of publication.<br><br>\u2022  Gamification: Get game coins (litcoins) for reading books. Litecoins can be spent on bookcase upgrades and other game features.<br><br>\u2022  Literary Value: Enjoy reading books in the public domain, as well as works by contemporary authors with whom we have publishing agreements.<br><br>Welcome to the world of words lovers, combining the passion of collecting and the joy of reading in one place!",
